<title>GERMANY: VEW details 9-mo results.</title>
<headline>VEW details 9-mo results.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   129     vs 119</p>
<p>    Group sales				  6,238   vs 6,312</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>    -VEW Energie				 4,467   vs 4,570</p>
<p>    -MEAG					  949     vs 942</p>
<p>    -Edelhoff				    652     vs 649</p>
<p>    Investments				  580     vs 794</p>
<p>    No of employees (at 30.9.95)	   13,345  vs 13,231</p>
<p>Sales in million kilowatt-hours</p>
<p>    Electricity sales			  32,286  vs 32,009</p>
<p>    Gas sales				    29,414  vs 25,347</p>
<p>    District heat				2,026   vs 1,754</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German utilities group is VEW AG. The group said group operating profits fell slightly, while financial results grew clearly.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
